{"id": 26573, "group": "nobroker-oa", "sent_at": "2026-11-12T09:16:57.548733+00:00", "text": "Given an array of size n (10^5),telling the scores of n people before the final race ,\nNow in the final race the person who comes first is given n points,second is given n-1 and so on where the person in the last place is given 1 point.(There cannot be a tie). After the final race, all the players with highest score are given trophy.\nFrom this we need to tell the number of people who have the chances of winning the trophy. for example if n=5, points=[12,14,14,15,15]. output = 4, since player 1 cannot win the trophy even if he wins the race, max points he will score is 12+5 = 17, but highest score in that race would be atleast 18.", "author_tag": "IITR", "reply_to": {"id": 25233, "text": "nobroker sde OA ques ??", "author_tag": "IITG"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
{"id": 26612, "group": "nobroker-oa", "sent_at": "2026-11-12T09:24:35.971715+00:00", "text": "nobroker data scientist ?", "author_tag": "IITK", "reply_to": null, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
{"id": 26667, "group": "nobroker-oa", "sent_at": "2026-11-12T10:58:01.76286+00:00", "text": "one experience shared here for Associate Data Scientist role, selected, December 2021.\n\nprocess was: Online Test + 2 interview rounds (medium difficulty overall).\n\ntopics covered across the whole process: Machine Learning, Data Science, Recommender Systems, resume/projects, basic ML questions.\n\nthe interviewers were described as interactive and helpful when stuck, so do prepare your projects well and be ready to discuss them in depth.\n\nOAHelper has 3 Nobroker coding questions collected, topics include simulation, math, arrays, binary tree and string matching.\n\nno specific data scientist OA format details available from experiences, but ML + DS fundamentals + your resume projects are the key areas to focus on.\n\nGave this OA recently? Do reply and correct me, helpful reply gets the coins on this question 🪙\nMore experiences here: https://oahelper.in/interview-experiences", "author_tag": null, "reply_to": {"id": 26612, "text": "nobroker data scientist ?", "author_tag": "IITK"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
